      <link>https://www.farmersweekly.co.za/agri-news/south-africa/recycling-pilot-project-aims-to-cut-waste-at-kruger-park/#utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=recycling-pilot-project-aims-to-cut-waste-at-kruger-park</link>
      <description>A recycling pilot project at Kruger National Park is successfully diverting significant volumes of waste from landfills and into South Africa’s circular economy, with lessons that could extend far beyond the park’s boundaries and into agricultural and rural settings.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.farmersweekly.co.za/agri-news/south-africa/recycling-pilot-project-aims-to-cut-waste-at-kruger-park/#utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=recycling-pilot-project-aims-to-cut-waste-at-kruger-park</guid>
