      <title>Managing ascites in broilers starts with prevention</title>
      <link>https://www.farmersweekly.co.za/animals/poultry/managing-ascites-in-broilers-starts-with-prevention/#utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=managing-ascites-in-broilers-starts-with-prevention</link>
      <description>Ascites is one of the most economically damaging conditions in broiler production. It often becomes visible late in the production cycle but starts much earlier, and once clinical signs appear, there is no treatment, thus producers must remain vigilant.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.farmersweekly.co.za/animals/poultry/managing-ascites-in-broilers-starts-with-prevention/#utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=managing-ascites-in-broilers-starts-with-prevention</guid>
